# Backend Rules

Stack: **Python 3.12+, FastAPI, Pydantic, pydantic-settings** — not Supabase/PostgreSQL.

## Structure
- `api.py` — thin route handlers only
- `services/*.py` — orchestration
- `blockchain.py`, `block.py`, `transaction.py` — domain
- `models.py` — Pydantic request/response schemas
- `exceptions.py` — AppError hierarchy
- `settings.py` / `config.py` — CHAIN_* env configuration

## Requirements
- Type hints on all public functions
- Validate inputs via Pydantic models or explicit checks
- Log with `blockchain` logger; use structured errors (AppError)
- Never expose stack traces when CHAIN_DEBUG=false
- Persist via ChainStore/WalletStore — do not bypass services

## API changes
- Add OpenAPI summary/description
- Document new env vars in .env.example
- Update CHANGELOG.md with what/why/impact/risks

## Testing when practical
- pytest for validation, crypto, service methods in tests/
